@SwampRabbit Thanks for the extra information! Your hunch absolutely makes sense; it looks like we do not forward the input/output streams of the parent process to the `git fetch` command, so if the git command is interactive, that gets swallowed. https://github.com/cli/cli/blob/3b20dfc03218d1e6d6036689f9f79a8a6c254344/pkg/cmd/repo/sync/git.go#L66-L73

